+# Meme Ecology Implementation Ticket Backlog
+
+## Delivery Rule
+
+Do not begin with open-ended generative media. Begin with event provenance, authored grammars, deterministic templates, rejection, and one local distribution graph.
+
+# Milestone A — Authoritative Foundations
+
+- **ME-001:** Define meme, variant, exposure and meaning identifiers.
+- **ME-002:** Bind artifacts to worldline and Chronicle tick.
+- **ME-003:** Implement source-event envelope.
+- **ME-004:** Implement observer-claim filtering.
+- **ME-005:** Implement privacy ceiling.
+- **ME-006:** Add source-event debug view.
+- **ME-007:** Validate source chronology.
+- **ME-008:** Add deterministic foundry seed derivation.
+- **ME-009:** Store grammar versions and output hashes.
+- **ME-010:** Add no-artifact outcome as first-class result.
+
+# Milestone B — Feature Extraction and Genome
+
+- **ME-011:** Implement contradiction features.
+- **ME-012:** Implement compression features.
+- **ME-013:** Implement social relevance features.
+- **ME-014:** Implement novelty and fatigue lookup.
+- **ME-015:** Implement meme seed structure.
+- **ME-016:** Implement genome schema validation.
+- **ME-017:** Add frame compatibility rules.
+- **ME-018:** Add media-affordance inference.
+- **ME-019:** Add target and beneficiary fields.
+- **ME-020:** Build candidate assessment trace.
+
+# Milestone C — Authored Grammar Proof
+
+- **ME-021:** Public-works grammar.
+- **ME-022:** Continuance domestic grammar.
+- **ME-023:** Vast and Magnanimous grammar.
+- **ME-024:** Clinical grammar and privacy gates.
+- **ME-025:** Civic-witness grammar.
+- **ME-026:** Atlas technician grammar.
+- **ME-027:** Two distinct machine-lineage grammars.
+- **ME-028:** Youth and elder mutation grammar.
+- **ME-029:** Corporate imitation grammar.
+- **ME-030:** One alien sensory grammar.
+
