+
+- **ME-031:** Creator opportunity selection.
+- **ME-032:** Personality and relationship voice fit.
+- **ME-033:** Creator refusal path.
+- **ME-034:** Group collaboration path.
+- **ME-035:** Tool and medium access checks.
+- **ME-036:** Creator risk and fear state.
+- **ME-037:** Silence preference.
+- **ME-038:** Private audience selection.
+- **ME-039:** Authored fallback expression.
+- **ME-040:** Name, pronoun and identity regression suite.
+
+# Milestone E — Distribution and Selection
+
+- **ME-041:** Face-to-face channel.
+- **ME-042:** Household and workplace channels.
+- **ME-043:** Local mesh publication.
+- **ME-044:** Physical artifact persistence.
+- **ME-045:** Exposure response model.
+- **ME-046:** Constituency meaning state.
