+
+- **ME-051:** Lexical mutation operators.
+- **ME-052:** Visual mutation operators.
+- **ME-053:** Audio and motif mutation operators.
+- **ME-054:** Target and meaning inversion.
+- **ME-055:** Multi-parent remix.
