+- **ME-057:** Translation mutation.
+- **ME-058:** Commercial capture.
+- **ME-059:** Political capture.
+- **ME-060:** Revival predicates.
+
+# Milestone G — Player and IRIS Specificity
+
+- **ME-061:** Player-event eligibility filter.
+- **ME-062:** Noncentrality budget.
+- **ME-063:** Shared-history tokens.
+- **ME-064:** IRIS instrumental dryness.
+- **ME-065:** IRIS shared callback.
+- **ME-066:** IRIS silence and pressure gating.
+- **ME-067:** IRIS fork divergence.
