+
+# Cut Order
+
+If scope must shrink:
+
+1. cut full generated images and video;
+2. cut architectural mutation breadth;
+3. cut alien grammar count;
+4. cut commercial and political campaign variety;
+5. cut surfaced artifact count;
+6. retain provenance, privacy, voice distinction, selection, and no-artifact outcomes.
+
